@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"二階堂の話によれば、<br>エレベーターの中には<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_05_01\">桜羽の死体</link>が入って<br>降りてきたってことだろ。|#0204Trial05_Alisa001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:んで、<br>エレベーターの上には<br>蓮見の死体があった。|#0204Trial05_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ならその時点で<br>二階堂の話は<br>破綻してやがる。|#0204Trial05_Alisa003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"二階堂以外に、<br>犯人がエレベーターに<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_05_02\">乗ること</link>は<br>できなかったんだよ。|#0204Trial05_Alisa004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それに上の階には<br>３人が揃っていましたしね！|#0204Trial05_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ウチが<br>エレベーターに入ろうにも、<br>誰かが見ることに<br>なるはずだ……。|#0204Trial05_Alisa005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Serious_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"二階堂の証言でも、<br>誰かが乗れるような<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_05_03\">時間はなかった</link>んだろ？|#0204Trial05_Alisa006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"なら犯人はどこにもいねー。<br><link=\"Objection_02_04_05_04\">おめえ以外は</link>な。|#0204Trial05_Alisa007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


